sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant P as primary (shard 0)
  participant D as data shards
  participant Q as parity shards
  C->>P: write 4K in the middle of a stripe
  Note over P: old: read the whole stripe (full RMW)
  P->>D: read the rest of the stripe's data
  D-->>P: data
  P->>P: re-encode the whole stripe
  P->>D: write the changed shards
  P->>Q: write the new parity
  Note over P: FastEC: only the changed shard and parity<br/>(partial write, parity delta)
  Q-->>P: ack
  D-->>P: ack
  P-->>C: ack
